  "description": "Draft sampling table for the graph of the unchanged current-template y=-1/4 x^2-x+4. Frozen context: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/editions/modern-us-neutral/figures/evidence/tbl-p0028-01/context.json; SHA256 badd46071a5700c19d3d10f505cd3a920b3de0161034e05b0498059b8c429e3d. This is a byte-bound template projection, not finalized text or SOURCE/math approval. HOLD at lesson level: the nearby literal y=2x^4+4x-1 and p0027-math-1 blank correction remain unapproved and untouched. Modern additions: equalized cell widths, semantic ink, clean rules without scan damage, 20px English/math labels and canvas margins at actual 640px scroll width. No extra vertex column, filled blank, formula label or lateral vertical border is added.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/tbl-p0028-01.png",
      "sha256": "27a683b79456d2f06a8a974c4d9a38bd6e8a74f311d40ccdb9f0bad5bfb8930c"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n5",
        "text": "我们分别用$m$和$n$表示式$-\\frac{b}{2a}$和$-\\frac{b^2-4ac}{4a}$的值. 于是方程（1）具有下列形式：\n$y=a(x-m)^2+n$. （2）"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n5",
        "text": "在坐标平面上描出上表中列出坐标的点，并用光滑的曲线把它们连结后，我们就得到函数$y=2x^4+4x-1$的图象（图6）."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n5",
        "text": "描出下表中列出坐标的几个点，并用光滑的曲线把它们连结后，我们就得到函数$y=-\\frac{1}{4}x^2-x+4$的图象（图7）."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n5",
        "text": "我们求出抛物线顶点的坐标. 根据公式$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$求横坐标，得到：\n$x=-\\frac{-1}{2\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)}=-2$. 由等式$y=-\\frac{1}{4}(-2)^2-(-2)+4$求出顶点的纵坐标等于5."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n5",
        "text": "在坐标平面上描出抛物线的顶点，即坐标为$(-2,5)$的点. 由于知道抛物线的对称轴是直线$x=-2$和抛物线的“开口”向下，我们就能想象出给定函数的图象的一般形状."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c1-s2-n5",
        "text": "图7"
      }
    ],
